      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.7151982409566613,
        "x1": 0.9670490818108755,
        "y1": 0.732035363444322
      },
      "text": "en Alaska durant la seconde guerre mondiale,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.7244030572199335,
        "x1": 0.5376830304447483,
        "y1": 0.7404384119700866
      },
      "text": "mansarde. L’ordre parfait qui y régnait permit de la vider en",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.7436454829201173,
        "x1": 0.537492386146238,
        "y1": 0.7596808376702704
      },
      "text": "quelques heures. Je pris bientôt possession de mon nouveau",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.735402797729058,
        "x1": 0.9667026515578132,
        "y1": 0.7522399202167188
      },
      "text": "il crée en 1947 les Expéditions polaires françaises",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.7628879086203011,
        "x1": 0.5348588644475852,
        "y1": 0.7789232633704541
      },
      "text": "domaine. Je passais des heures dans la mansarde vide, assis dans",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.7556073545014548,
        "x1": 0.9622536444560389,
        "y1": 0.7724444769891156
      },
      "text": "et dirigera 31 missions dans les étendues glacées.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.7821303343204848,
        "x1": 0.535835247243802,
        "y1": 0.7981656890706379
      },
      "text": "un coin, imaginant son installation, mettant au point le système",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.7803579206434346,
        "x1": 0.9667166181730886,
        "y1": 0.7971950431310955
      },
      "text": "Ethnologue, écrivain, il s’engage dès les années",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.8013727600206686,
        "x1": 0.5352840896884934,
        "y1": 0.8174081147708216
      },
      "text": "d’éclairage, combinant les rayonnages et les meubles que j’allais",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.8005624651818266,
        "x1": 0.9621877103930925,
        "y1": 0.8173995876694874
      },
      "text": "70 « pour la défense de l’homme et de l’environne-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.8206151857208523,
        "x1": 0.5358599797916858,
        "y1": 0.8366505404710054
      },
      "text": "fabriquer. J’ai souvent pensé, depuis, à cette période de travail",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.8207670097202187,
        "x1": 0.9621995820160767,
        "y1": 0.8376041322078794
      },
      "text": "ment »,avec notamment Haroun Tazieff, Jacques-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.8398576114210361,
        "x1": 0.5358561971667153,
        "y1": 0.8558929661711893
      },
      "text": "intense et de concentration, au cours de laquelle une idée prend",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.8409715542586106,
        "x1": 0.6925720373248445,
        "y1": 0.8578086767462714
      },
      "text": "Yves Cousteau.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.8591000371212199,
        "x1": 0.5347519616464975,
        "y1": 0.875135391871373
      },
      "text": "la forme d’un projet dans ses grandes lignes, puis dans ses détails,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.8657221204005905,
        "x1": 0.9621515135818369,
        "y1": 0.8825592428882513
      },
      "text": "« Les vieux aventuriers ne meurent pas, ils dispa-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.8783424628214036,
        "x1": 0.5357360842753461,
        "y1": 0.8943778175715568
      },
      "text": "jusqu’au moment où, tout étant prêt, il ne reste plus qu’à passer à",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.8859266649389824,
        "x1": 0.9660679270877729,
        "y1": 0.9027637874266432
      },
      "text": "raissent, ils s’évanouissent... » C’est ce qu’écrivait",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.8975848885215874,
        "x1": 0.5358599215974554,
        "y1": 0.9136202432717405
      },
      "text": "l’exécution. (L’expression « il ne reste plus qu’à» est  évidemment",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5729734083689926,
        "y0": 0.9061312094773745,
        "x1": 0.7592070497753185,
        "y1": 0.9229683319650352
      },
      "text": "PEV, c’est ce qu’il a fait.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864863071601794,
        "y0": 0.9168273142217711,
        "x1": 0.34566488254516037,
        "y1": 0.9328626689719243
      },
      "text": "inadéquate : le plus gros reste à faire.)“",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
  ],
